hiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p001","quote":"孝景皇帝子凡十三人為王，而母五人，同母者為宗親。栗姬子曰榮、德、閼于。程姬子曰餘、非、端。賈夫人子曰彭祖、勝。唐姬子曰發。王夫人兒姁子曰越、寄、乘、舜。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"程姬子曰","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依明示子、生、母與局部世系主語保存，不因繼位或太子稱本身補父子，不補未名成員及同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji059-026","person_id":"1c8_u63_bk4_F","title":"膠西于王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p013","quote":"膠西于王端，以孝景前三年吳楚七國反破後，端用皇子為膠西王。端為人賊戾，又陰痿，一近婦人，病之數月。而有愛幸少年為郎。為郎者頃之與後宮亂，端禽滅之，及殺其子母。數犯上法，漢公卿數請誅端，天子為兄弟之故不忍，而端所為滋甚。有司再請削其國，去太半。端心慍，遂為無訾省。府庫壞漏盡，腐財物以巨萬計，終不得收徙。令吏毋得收租賦。端皆去衛，封其宮門，從一門出游。數變名姓，為布衣，之他郡國。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji059-026:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p013","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"膠西于王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m013-0000","usage":"retrospective"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"來源授封、徙封、承爵、職位與用稱分存；相對年數保持原語，不換算公曆或由死亡、首次提及補起訖。王號中的諡字不當生前正式授爵名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji059-027","person_id":"1c8_u63_bk4_F","title":"膠西王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p013","quote":"膠西于王端，以孝景前三年吳楚七國反破後，端用皇子為膠西王。端為人賊戾，又陰痿，一近婦人，病之數月。而有愛幸少年為郎。為郎者頃之與後宮亂，端禽滅之，及殺其子母。數犯上法，漢公卿數請誅端，天子為兄弟之故不忍，而端所為滋甚。有司再請削其國，去太半。端心慍，遂為無訾省。府庫壞漏盡，腐財物以巨萬計，終不得收徙。令吏毋得收租賦。端皆去衛，封其宮門，從一門出游。數變名姓，為布衣，之他郡國。"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p015","quote":"立四十七年，卒，竟無男代後，國除，地入于漢，為膠西郡。","context":{"kind":"previous_paragraph_subject","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p014","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m014-0014","quote":"相、二千石往者，奉漢法以治，端輒求其罪告之，無罪者詐藥殺之。所以設詐究變，彊足以距諫，智足以飾非。相、二千石從王治，則漢繩以法。故膠西小國，而所殺傷二千石甚眾。"}}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji059-027:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p013","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"膠西王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m013-0025","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":"孝景前三年","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p013","quote":"膠西于王端，以孝景前三年吳楚七國反破後，端用皇子為膠西王。端為人賊戾，又陰痿，一近婦人，病之數月。而有愛幸少年為郎。為郎者頃之與後宮亂，端禽滅之，及殺其子母。數犯上法，漢公卿數請誅端，天子為兄弟之故不忍，而端所為滋甚。有司再請削其國，去太半。端心慍，遂為無訾省。府庫壞漏盡，腐財物以巨萬計，終不得收徙。令吏毋得收租賦。端皆去衛，封其宮門，從一門出游。數變名姓，為布衣，之他郡國。"}]},"end":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"abolition","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p015","quote":"立四十七年，卒，竟無男代後，國除，地入于漢，為膠西郡。","context":{"kind":"previous_paragraph_subject","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p014","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:m014-0014","quote":"相、二千石往者，奉漢法以治，端輒求其罪告之，無罪者詐藥殺之。所以設詐究變，彊足以距諫，智足以飾非。相、二千石從王治，則漢繩以法。故膠西小國，而所殺傷二千石甚眾。"}}]}},"interpretation_note":"來源授封、徙封、承爵、職位與用稱分存；相對年數保持原語，不換算公曆或由死亡、首次提及補起訖。王號中的諡字不當生前正式授爵名。 終點依明示廢、徙、國除／國絕或太子代立，不延伸至其他官爵。 第15段省略主語，國除承前段端與膠西敘事；保存直接前段的端錨點，不補字入本文。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji059-012","person_id":"1c8_u63_bk4_F","surfaces":["王","端","膠西于王端","膠西王"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p001","quote":"孝景皇帝子凡十三人為王，而母五人，同母者為宗親。栗姬子曰榮、德、閼于。程姬子曰餘、非、端。賈夫人子曰彭祖、勝。唐姬子曰發。王夫人兒姁子曰越、寄、乘、舜。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p013","quote":"膠西于王端，以孝景前三年吳楚七國反破後，端用皇子為膠西王。端為人賊戾，又陰痿，一近婦人，病之數月。而有愛幸少年為郎。為郎者頃之與後宮亂，端禽滅之，及殺其子母。數犯上法，漢公卿數請誅端，天子為兄弟之故不忍，而端所為滋甚。有司再請削其國，去太半。端心慍，遂為無訾省。府庫壞漏盡，腐財物以巨萬計，終不得收徙。令吏毋得收租賦。端皆去衛，封其宮門，從一門出游。數變名姓，為布衣，之他郡國。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p014","quote":"相、二千石往者，奉漢法以治，端輒求其罪告之，無罪者詐藥殺之。所以設詐究變，彊足以距諫，智足以飾非。相、二千石從王治，則漢繩以法。故膠西小國，而所殺傷二千石甚眾。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p039","quote":"【索隱述贊】景十三子，五宗親睦。栗姬既廢，臨江折軸。閼於早薨，河間儒服。餘好宮苑，端事馳逐。江都有才，中山禔福。長沙地小，膠東造鏃。仁賢者代，浡亂者族。兒姁四王，分封為六。"}],"rationale":"依明示姓名、母子世系、局部王系及承爵敘事暫接；同名慶分支保存，王號不跨世代或支系套用，名非不當普通否定詞。未名皇帝、群體、指控與制度職稱不補事實；版本、跨篇與有效時段待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji059-duan","person_ids":["trv_fic_8ej","1c8_u63_bk4_F"],"canonical_person_id":"trv_fic_8ej","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-011-jingdi","c-shiji-059-wuzong"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi","source_id":"s-shiji-011-jingdi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:p004","quote":"三年正月乙巳，赦天下。長星出西方。天火燔雒陽東宮大殿城室。吳王濞、楚王戊、趙王遂、膠西王卬、濟南王辟光、菑川王賢、膠東王雄渠反，發兵西鄉。天子為誅晁錯，遣袁盎諭告，不止，遂西圍梁。上乃遣大將軍竇嬰、太尉周亞夫將兵誅之。六月乙亥。赦亡軍及楚元王子藝等與謀反者。封大將軍竇嬰為魏其侯。立楚元王子平陸侯禮為楚王。立皇子端為膠西王，子勝為中山王。徙濟北王志為菑川王，淮陽王餘為魯王，汝南王非為江都王。齊王將廬、燕王嘉皆薨。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0154"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong","source_id":"s-shiji-059-wuzong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-059-wuzong:p013","quote":"膠西于王端，以孝景前三年吳楚七國反破後，端用皇子為膠西王。端為人賊戾，又陰痿，一近婦人，病之數月。而有愛幸少年為郎。為郎者頃之與後宮亂，端禽滅之，及殺其子母。數犯上法，漢公卿數請誅端，天子為兄弟之故不忍，而端所為滋甚。有司再請削其國，去太半。端心慍，遂為無訾省。府庫壞漏盡，腐財物以巨萬計，終不得收徙。令吏毋得收租賦。端皆去衛，封其宮門，從一門出游。數變名姓，為布衣，之他郡國。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-059-wuzong:m013-0000","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m013-0020","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m013-0025","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m013-0029","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m013-0068","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m013-0090","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m013-0103","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m013-0121","c-shiji-059-wuzong:m013-0159"]}],"rationale":"同記吳楚反後皇子端為膠西王，姓名、父系及授封事件相配，不接本紀反者膠西王卬。 原ID與各篇文字保留，身份暫接不統一年數、王國細節或史實優先；同書各篇不作獨立見證。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:p004","text":"三年正月乙巳，赦天下。長星出西方。天火燔雒陽東宮大殿城室。吳王濞、楚王戊、趙王遂、膠西王卬、濟南王辟光、菑川王賢、膠東王雄渠反，發兵西鄉。天子為誅晁錯，遣袁盎諭告，不止，遂西圍梁。上乃遣大將軍竇嬰、太尉周亞夫將兵誅之。六月乙亥。赦亡軍及楚元王子藝等與謀反者。封大將軍竇嬰為魏其侯。立楚元王子平陸侯禮為楚王。立皇子端為膠西王，子勝為中山王。徙濟北王志為菑川王，淮陽王餘為魯王，汝南王非為江都王。齊王將廬、燕王嘉皆薨。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"吳王濞","kind":"person","person_id":"tpx_x74_xhk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"楚王戊","kind":"person","person_id":"5jd_t02_cdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"趙王遂","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AEA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0041","start":41,"end":45,"surface":"膠西王卬","kind":"person","person_id":"naf_4g1_vmz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0046","start":46,"end":51,"surface":"濟南王辟光","kind":"person","person_id":"sym_fqo_4zf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0052","start":52,"end":56,"surface":"菑川王賢","kind":"person","person_id":"vrf_8lm_g7h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0057","start":57,"end":62,"surface":"膠東王雄渠","kind":"person","person_id":"tc7_le7_5xb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"晁錯","kind":"person","person_id":"f0u_lxn_ztw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"袁盎","kind":"person","person_id":"ibu_a0b_ggu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0090","start":90,"end":91,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"竇嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"nvf_r2k_j9y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0101","start":101,"end":104,"surface":"周亞夫","kind":"person","person_id":"nwx_f88_xfu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0118","start":118,"end":121,"surface":"楚元王","kind":"person","person_id":"zju_pdu_xge","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"子藝","kind":"person","person_id":"zju_pdu_xge_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0133","start":133,"end":135,"surface":"竇嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"nvf_r2k_j9y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0141","start":141,"end":144,"surface":"楚元王","kind":"person","person_id":"zju_pdu_xge","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0145","start":145,"end":149,"surface":"平陸侯禮","kind":"person","person_id":"zju_pdu_xge_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0154","start":154,"end":157,"surface":"皇子端","kind":"person","person_id":"trv_fic_8ej","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"子勝","kind":"person","person_id":"e4a_qz6_z0d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0170","start":170,"end":174,"surface":"濟北王志","kind":"person","person_id":"xgj_1sl_ys8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0179","start":179,"end":183,"surface":"淮陽王餘","kind":"person","person_id":"n35_voj_gm8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0187","start":187,"end":191,"surface":"汝南王非","kind":"person","person_id":"lg4_vfn_f2t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0196","start":196,"end":200,"surface":"齊王將廬","kind":"person","person_id":"2mw_zet_vw9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m004-0201","start":201,"end":204,"surface":"燕王嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"u2w_08q_du4","status":"contex